{"schema":3,"source_digest":"787c9c49b67ee490b956cca0ea3ce3101b9c20db5fd8fd2c35f1b66300cbd116","dependencies":[],"processor_digest":"0e7e287f498782225c86635c4b16151adcc5552dc8a023621b89169c269e3a64","result":{"html":"<html><head></head><body><h1 id=\"sessiond-uaccess\">sessiond-uaccess</h1>\n<p><code>sessiond-uaccess</code> grants device-node access to active local sessions by\nwriting POSIX ACL entries.</p>\n<h2 id=\"rules\">Rules</h2>\n<p>Rules are Lua files loaded from the configured rules directories:</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-lua\"><span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">device</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(229,192,123);font-weight: bold;\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">access</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"rw\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">match</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">dev</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">)</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">return</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">dev</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">subsystem</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">==</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"sound\"</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">end</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(229,192,123);font-weight: bold;\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n</body></html>","headers":[{"text":"sessiond-uaccess","level":1,"id":"sessiond-uaccess"},{"text":"Rules","level":2,"id":"rules"}],"title":"sessiond-uaccess","included_files":[]},"frontmatter":null}